'''Sagat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 574
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sagat
|name2 = Sagat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sagat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sagat is a Street Fighter that takes advantage of the ability Strengthen to an extreme level, which, in most midgame circumstances, is not a negative factor. However, later throughout the game, this problem starts to show more and more. Luckily, he has other defining abilities.

Sagat is built purely as an [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] nuker, or in wider usage, a midrange generalist. Without Strengthen, he has about 18k DPS against Floating enemies, which isn't ideal for [[Uncanny Legends]] stages and later [[Stories of Legend]] stages. Adding to that, his range of 350 is only decent; as in those later stages, enemies progress frighteningly quickly without a quick counter. With that being said, his below-average attack power gets boosted to up to 28k damage against Floating enemies, which is great!

With that being said, his generalist stats lack overall as a whole, as similar to most [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collab Cats]], he lacks in overall pure stats, and is not the most ideal generalist. If you have any better generalists, or more spammable cats like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], then you could use them in place of him.

The only real issue with this Street Fighter is his reliance on Strengthen; as without it, Sagat is far less effective against both Floating and non-Floating enemies.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & Nuker}}

